<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MasterClock core — tr (Turkish)

  The voice strings are spoken aloud by the phone's text-to-speech, so they are written to be heard:
  a player's number never carries a suffix ("Oyuncu 2, süre doldu" rather than an ordinal), which
  would depend on how the number is pronounced.

  Translated without a native reviewer, like every language here except the French.
-->
